            "A route with no break",
            "A route that stops at the line",
            "None"
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "explanation": "A sudden break can create a step of separation from a defender who has to follow.",
          "concept": "man-coverage"
        },
        {
          "type": "true_false",
          "id": "a3-manzone-06",
          "statement": "Against zone, receivers try to settle in the gaps between defenders.",
          "answer": true,
          "explanation": "Zones leave windows. Finding and sitting in them beats zone.",
          "concept": "zone-coverage"
